/*
 * Declares the ImportInfo class.
 *
 * ImportInfo is the record of what a single `use` path brought into a scope,
 * and of what a name resolution actually reached through it.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::import_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/import_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-11
